1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
They are dispatched to the accident scene.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,500
The Go Team is on call twenty-four hours a day.

3
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,500
They are led by an Investigator-in-Charge — the IIC.

4
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Specialists cover every angle: operations, structures, systems, air traffic control, weather, human performance, survival factors, powerplants, metallurgy, and the cockpit and flight data recorders.

5
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:07,110
This is a mobile lab.

6
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:07,610
The Go Team secures the site and starts the factual record.

